Description: Agent Computer application composition preview
 Composes native Agent intelligence, WebOS, desktop, Obsidian, chat, vault
 sync, security, MCP capabilities, and CX through APT and DPKG dependencies.
 Compatible public native AGOS, merged Router, Model LLM, CX Agent, and renamed vault-sync
 releases remain unverified. Obsidian requires its reviewed official upstream DEB.
 This composition does not establish Agent Apps or Agent Computer readiness.
